    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The p50, p95 and p99 of the duration of the successful calls (status ok) of the selected job, command and sub-command, over a window of $__rate_interval, at least 1 h (Min step 15m). With All, the quantiles are of all the calls together. Metric: devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds. A run of a command group with no sub-command, such as devops ci, sends no point to this histogram (#5192).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisLabel": "Latency (s)",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 62,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds{job=~\"$job\",command=~\"$command\",sub_command=~\"$sub_command\",status=\"ok\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "interval": "15m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds{job=~\"$job\",command=~\"$command\",sub_command=~\"$sub_command\",status=\"ok\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "interval": "15m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds{job=~\"$job\",command=~\"$command\",sub_command=~\"$sub_command\",status=\"ok\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "interval": "15m"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latency: p50, p95 and p99 of successful calls",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The calls of the selected job, command and sub-command in each hour, ok and error together. Each bar is the hour before its time (Min interval 1h). Metric: histogram_count of devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds. A run of a command group with no sub-command, such as devops ci, sends no point to this histogram (#5192). Approximate: increase() needs two samples of a series inside its window, and delta points from one process can arrive out of order (#792), so a count can come out low.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisLabel": "Calls per hour",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 50,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "barAlignment": -1
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 63,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "round(histogram_count(sum(increase(devops_cli_subcommand_duration_seconds{job=~\"$job\",command=~\"$command\",sub_command=~\"$sub_command\"}[$__interval]))))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "calls"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Traffic: calls per hour",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "interval": "1h",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
